  "title": "Cheesy Stuffed Cauliflower",
  "description": "Give cauliflower a cheesy makeover by removing its stem, dipping it in egg and bread crumbs, and filling it with Colby-Jack cheese for a flavorful side dish everyone will love.",
  "authors": [
    "booyachic"
  ],
